      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنهضهُ لِأَمْرِ كَذَا</span></b>  <i>He ordered him,</i> or <i>commanded him, to rise to [do,</i> or <i>perform,</i>] <i>such an
affair.</i> (S, K. *) [And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنهضهُ فِى أَمْرٍ</span>] <i>He sent
